 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 46,
   "sec": 2,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Prisoners' rights cases:** **Hussainara Khatoon v. State of Bihar (1979)** - speedy trial is part of Article 21 (undertrials); **Sunil Batra v. Delhi Administration (1978)** - prisoners keep their fundamental rights."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 46,
   "sec": 2,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Prison Statistics India:** published every year by the **National Crime Records Bureau (NCRB)**, under the **MHA**."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 46,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Report:** **NITI Aayog** released the **\"Strategic Roadmap for Making Ayurveda Global\"** on **2 July 2026**."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 47,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **NDMA crowd-management guidelines** also call for **separate entry and exit routes** and **real-time monitoring through CCTV and drones**."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 47,
   "sec": 4,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **State of West Bengal v. Union of India (1962)**: the Supreme Court described India as **quasi-federal** (not a true federation)."
  },
  {
   "book": 6,
   "row": 47,
   "sec": 4,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Gadgil-Mukherjee criteria for Special Category Status:** **hilly and difficult terrain**; **low population density or a sizeable tribal population**; **strategic location along international borders**; economic and infrastructure backwardness; non-viable State finances."
  }
 ],
